          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Let’s grab an AsciiDoc document to distill and start putting Asciidoctor PDF to use. If you don’t already have an AsciiDoc document, you can download and use the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
